    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441370/extras/445b7a0ce6ece1d8cca17956975d8a70.poster.avif?t=1748532688\" width=608 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441370/extras/445b7a0ce6ece1d8cca17956975d8a70.webm?t=1748532688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441370/extras/445b7a0ce6ece1d8cca17956975d8a70.mp4?t=1748532688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rag Doll is a 2D fighting based on physics. Control the character's head and the body will follow it. The game looks like a book illustration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can expect:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unusual control of your character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nice visual and music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure, touching different events at different periods of time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles against other players</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid not only other fighter's attacks but also unfriendly objects at the levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441370/extras/1bb237eb548c09d26d9c2bb87f0e0428.poster.avif?t=1748532688\" width=608 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441370/extras/1bb237eb548c09d26d9c2bb87f0e0428.webm?t=1748532688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441370/extras/1bb237eb548c09d26d9c2bb87f0e0428.mp4?t=1748532688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles against AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local versus battle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character and go to the fight!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441370/extras/445b7a0ce6ece1d8cca17956975d8a70.poster.avif?t=1748532688\" width=608 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441370/extras/445b7a0ce6ece1d8cca17956975d8a70.webm?t=1748532688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441370/extras/445b7a0ce6ece1d8cca17956975d8a70.mp4?t=1748532688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rag Doll is a 2D fighting based on physics. Control the character's head and the body will follow it. The game looks like a book illustration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can expect:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unusual control of your character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nice visual and music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure, touching different events at different periods of time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles against other players</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid not only other fighter's attacks but also unfriendly objects at the levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441370/extras/1bb237eb548c09d26d9c2bb87f0e0428.poster.avif?t=1748532688\" width=608 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441370/extras/1bb237eb548c09d26d9c2bb87f0e0428.webm?t=1748532688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441370/extras/1bb237eb548c09d26d9c2bb87f0e0428.mp4?t=1748532688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles against AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local versus battle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character and go to the fight!</p>",
    "short_description": "Fighting based on physics. Rag Doll is a 2D game with cartoon graphics, where you control the character's head, and the body moves according to the laws of physics! Play Story Mode, fight in multiplayer or local battle 1 vs 1!",
    "supported_languages": "English, Ukrainian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Spain",
